{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Microvania is a tiny metroidvania</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So tiny, that the screen resolution is only 160x90!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's so small that you can also complete the game in a single session!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore the depths of planet Micronus</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traverse and backtrack through meticulously crafted pixels of caves, jungles, labs, ruins, and more. \u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3114890/extras/980a254f13ecf5c0b07f168f1d1d29ff.poster.avif?t=1761599670\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3114890/extras/980a254f13ecf5c0b07f168f1d1d29ff.webm?t=1761599670\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3114890/extras/980a254f13ecf5c0b07f168f1d1d29ff.mp4?t=1761599670\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Almost every room has a hidden item or a secret path. \u00a0Can you find them all?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Find and make use of classic upgrade tropes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3114890/extras/6647755d4a787007a411448016758ee6.poster.avif?t=1761599670\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3114890/extras/6647755d4a787007a411448016758ee6.webm?t=1761599670\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3114890/extras/6647755d4a787007a411448016758ee6.mp4?t=1761599670\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Missiles, Claw, Ball-Mode and more!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Customise your play style</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3114890/extras/3dc164e1c69b30b77022cc84ca0ea82c.poster.avif?t=1761599670\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3114890/extras/3dc164e1c69b30b77022cc84ca0ea82c.webm?t=1761599670\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3114890/extras/3dc164e1c69b30b77022cc84ca0ea82c.mp4?t=1761599670\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Equip Microcards to modify your weapons and abilities. \u00a0Create your own play style. \u00a0Just make sure you've found enough Microcells to power them.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Microvania respects your time</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3114890/extras/f9cb70686949fc0b3d93d33f009757b7.poster.avif?t=1761599670\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3114890/extras/f9cb70686949fc0b3d93d33f009757b7.webm?t=1761599670\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3114890/extras/f9cb70686949fc0b3d93d33f009757b7.mp4?t=1761599670\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don\u2019t worry about saving your progress - the game will create a checkpoint every time you enter a room, and you will spawn back here if you die.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And quitting to the main menu will save your game where you are, so you can jump right back in on your next session.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Accessibility &amp; Full Controller Support</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3114890/extras/70b93cdf089de999994b6f7a7fb6efbd.avif?t=1761599670\" width=640 height=360 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designed for controllers, with fully customisable buttons. \u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3114890/extras/c88539d76af05b767cc79f565b0d9f70.webp?t=1761599670\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3114890/extras/c88539d76af05b767cc79f565b0d9f70.poster.avif?t=1761599670\" class=\"bb_img\" width=640 height=360 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Including accessibility options like rapid fire or toggle modes for various functions. \u00a0If a boss gives you trouble, you can use the &quot;Respawn at Boss&quot; setting to  make them easier to fight.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Friends of Shnail","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3114890/5e572ecd4b1d1d704e83b6f7403a20ca064481b1.jpg"},{"name":"Minimalist","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3114890/0273cb027eff28c65c82e5aad35fad741128b14c.jpg"},{"name":"Anti-Missiles","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3114890/3e7624b1de3210a04af19378028564e02d436c1c.jpg"},{"name":"Anti-Health","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3114890/ac9554a31de48fa0ea797f53acb8f7c4c9370163.jpg"},{"name":"Found The Exit","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3114890/3dba968dfd7c7468ca05a080d5e7ebb5d5e7bd97.jpg"},{"name":"Speedrunner","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3114890/65c49dd6436e2e6bbdf240166ef110454932e9e6.jpg"},{"name":"Full Set","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3114890/bd514bf788813e2ee4cf6ab0a2d98c1a3eb8ecdc.jpg"},{"name":"Completionist","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3114890/21b54549ddbd69bd63ab35a5f7b372eec095b598.jpg"},{"name":"Cartographer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3114890/10eb7eaf2d064d37d5c6f4d88985e751a5ba406f.jpg"},{"name":"Hadouken!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3114890/5ec3e063562034ad18f756ea0e33006cec6f2da1.jpg"}],"total":13},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3114890?t=1761599670","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3114890/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761599670","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3114890/ff6fb64eeb667d08f58f7160f5cd272de1789f3c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761599670","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3114890/ff6fb64eeb667d08f58f7160f5cd272de1789f3c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761599670","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3351870,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Microvania is a tiny metroidvania</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So tiny, that the screen resolution is only 160x90!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's so small that you can also complete